		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Colossal sea abomination with an octopus head and a slimy, humanoid body.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 87, <strong>ATK</strong> 4 rend (near) +12 (4d8), <strong>MV</strong> far (fly, swim), <strong>S</strong> +6, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +6, <strong>I</strong> +4, <strong>W</strong> +5, <strong>Ch</strong> +5, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 18</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Chaos Incarnate</strong>. Mortals within near of Cthulhu, CHA 15+ or die. On success, immune.</p><p></p><p><strong>Madness</strong>. Warps reality for all mortals within far. Each turn, WIS 18+ or 2d4 WIS damage. Insane at 0 WIS.</p><p></p><p><strong>Non-Euclidean</strong>. Warps the weave of space and time. Attacks and spells against Cthulhu have DISADV.</p><p></p><p><strong>Pure Evil</strong>. Only damaged by magic sources. Dissolves if slain, reforms in Dreamlands.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
